<XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1" flags="0x0"><title>FlexFuel Activation Switch (S_FLEXFUEL)</title><description>S_FLEXFUEL - flexfuel activation switch (1x1 scalar). CODE-VERIFIED: the firmware reads this byte (ld.bu @0x80198FFE) as the flex-enable gate selecting the ethanol injection-timing/split maps over the gasoline maps (the 10 hidden FETH records). Address confirmed by disassembly; the addrmap record method just can't place 1x1 scalars. Toggling it switches flex mode - change with care.</description><CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="20" /><XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0"><EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" /><units>-</units><indexcount>1</indexcount><decimalpl>0</decimalpl><datatype>0</datatype><unittype>0</unittype><DALINK index="0" /><LABEL index="0" value="State" /><MATH equation="X"><VAR id="X" /></MATH></XDFAXIS><XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0"><EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" /><units>-</units><indexcount>1</indexcount><decimalpl>0</decimalpl><datatype>0</datatype><unittype>0</unittype><DALINK index="0" /><LABEL index="0" value="Value" /><MATH equation="X"><VAR id="X" /></MATH></XDFAXIS><XDFAXIS id="z" uniqueid="0x0"><EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x198FFE" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedrowcount="1" mmedcolcount="1" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" mmedtypeflags="0x2" /><units>0/1</units><decimalpl>0</decimalpl><min>0</min><max>1</max><outputtype>1</outputtype><MATH equation="X"><VAR id="X" /></MATH></XDFAXIS></XDFTABLE><XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2" flags="0x0"><title>unnamed@0x1AF94B</title><description>unnamed@0x1AF94B
